      "text": "{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R76/2006-GB1-12.05\",\n    \"project_number\": \"TS1201/0041\",\n    \"page_total\": 5,\n    \"member_state\": \"United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2014-08-22\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"National Measurement Office\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\"Stanton Avenue\", \"Teddington\", \"TW11 0JZ\", \"United Kingdom\"],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"Paul Dixon\",\n    \"person_title\": \"Director, Certification Services\",\n    \"phone\": \"+44 (0)20 8943 7272\",\n    \"website\": \"www.bis.gov.uk/nmo\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Avery Weigh-Tronix\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Foundry Lane\", \"Smethwick\", \"West Midlands B66 2LP\", \"United Kingdom\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Avery Weigh-Tronix\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Foundry Lane\", \"Smethwick\", \"West Midlands B66 2LP\", \"United Kingdom\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Non-automatic weighing instrument\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"ZQ375\", \"BSF-99\", \"BSF-1214\", \"BSG-99\", \"BSG-1214\", \"BS-1824\"],\n    \"description\": \"This family of instruments is designated the ZQ375 Checkweigher and comprises the Torsion base and Diamond base models. The instruments are Class III, mains or battery-powered, self-indicating, Non-Automatic Weighing Instruments, and are not designed for direct sales to the public. Devices: semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, pre-set tare, recall of gross indication when tare is active, determination and indication of stability of equilibrium, checking of display, printing, PLUs, alibi storage device, gravity compensation, real time clock, command via external device (PC), simple checkweighing (Sim375), mid-level checkweighing (Mid375), advanced checkweighing (Adv375), percentage checkweighing (Per375), grading